---
const items = [
  {
    q: 'Do I need a diagnosis to be here?',
    a: "No. Whether you're diagnosed, self-identifying, still wondering or just relate to these experiences, you're welcome in exactly the same way. Nobody will ask you to prove anything.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Is this only for autistic people?',
    a: "No. Neurodivergent is a wide word. It can include autism, ADHD, dyslexia, dyspraxia, Tourette's and other ways of thinking and sensing. Use whatever words fit you, or none.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Is Hum Jaise a medical or therapy service?',
    a: "No. We're peers, not doctors or counsellors, and we don't diagnose or treat anyone. If you need urgent help, the crisis numbers on this page are the place to start.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I talk to other people here yet?',
    a: "Not yet. Right now this is a website you can read, plus a form to write to us. We hope to add pseudonymous accounts and gently moderated conversations later, and we'll say clearly when that happens.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Who can see what I write to you?',
    a: "Only the small group who run Hum Jaise. It's stored by Netlify, which hosts the site. We won't publish any of it without asking you first. No website can promise complete anonymity, so leave out details that could identify you.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What if English or Urdu reading is hard for me?',
    a: 'Use Reading comfort at the top of the page to make the text bigger or more spaced out. Write to us in whatever language or style comes naturally. Short messages are completely fine.',
  },
];
---
<div class="faq">
  {items.map((it) => (
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>
        <span class="faq-q">{it.q}</span>
        <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="faq-a"><p>{it.a}</p></div>
    </details>
  ))}
</div>

<style>
  .faq { display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .faq-item {
    background: var(--plaster);
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 8%, transparent);
    transition: box-shadow 200ms ease-out;
  }
  .faq-item[open] { box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -26px rgb(51 40 63 / 0.4); }
  summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 60px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem 0.9rem 1.4rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    border-radius: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary:hover .faq-icon { background: var(--rose); }
  .faq-icon {
    flex: none;
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
    background: var(--plaster-edge);
    -webkit-mask: var(--star) center / contain no-repeat;
    mask: var(--star) center / contain no-repeat;
    transition: transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), background-color 180ms ease-out;
  }
  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); background: var(--sage); }
  .faq-a { padding: 0 1.4rem 1.25rem; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 62ch; }
  .faq-item[open] .faq-a { animation: faq-open 320ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
  @keyframes faq-open { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); } }
</style>
